#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:5
#: 337363c025ec4d32aba37b5665da3730
msgid "Yaw Tuning for Tilt Vectored Yaw Configurations"
msgstr "倾转矢量偏航配置的偏航调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:7
#: 51e4a6df5e1447b68a633c69d1dc9570
msgid ""
"Tuning the yaw axis is a bit different if tilt vectored yaw is utilized. "
"Tilt Vectored Tailsitters and Quadplanes like Tilt-Tricopter configurations "
"use tilting of the motors to accomplish yaw will need a slightly different "
"tuning process since the yaw response is not being driven by motor rotation "
"speed differentials. These systems will need the FF term determined and set "
"before tuning D and P terms for yaw. (This information is repeated in the "
":ref:`Tailsitter tuning <tailsitter-tuning-guide>` page)"
msgstr ""
"如果使用倾转矢量偏航，偏航轴的调参会有所不同。倾转矢量Tailsitter和倾转-"
"三旋翼配置等QuadPlane使用电机倾转来实现偏航，需要略微不同的调参过程，因为偏航响应不是由电机转速差驱动的。这些系统需要在调参偏航的D和P项之前确定并设置FF项。（此信息在"
" :ref:`Tailsitter tuning <tailsitter-tuning-guide>` 页面中重复出现）"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:9
#: cacda2c979434d768e8bac0e7cb28fec
msgid ""
"First, follow Steps 1 - 4 of the normal :ref:`QuadPlane Tuning Process "
"Setup<quadplane-vtol-tuning-process>`."
msgstr "首先，遵循正常 :ref:`QuadPlane调参流程设置<quadplane-vtol-tuning-process>` 的步骤1至4。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:10
#: b1a1743323274e98b1b9874f624a44eb
msgid ""
"Normally, the vehicle is stable enough with the default PIDs to do a first "
"test hover in QSTABILIZE or QHOVER. Do a short hover flight with logging "
"enabled such that the :ref:`Harmonic Notch Filters<common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>` can be setup. Its important to remove as much motor noise as "
"possible in order to get a good tune using a throttle based harmonic notch "
"filter."
msgstr ""
"通常，使用默认 PID 飞行器足够稳定，可以在 QSTABILIZE 或 QHOVER "
"中进行首次测试悬停。启用日志记录的情况下进行短暂悬停飞行，以便可以设置 :ref:`谐波陷波滤波器<common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>`。尽可能消除电机噪声非常重要，以便使用基于油门的谐波陷波滤波器获得良好的调参结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:11
#: 0dc7fb3fd40749a785f2648984c51d00
msgid ""
"Once the notch filters are set, do another hover flight but briefly do "
"short, but sharp yaw stick movements in both directions. Do not endanger the"
" vehicle, but try to get several short full stick movements right and left. "
"You should be able to hold full yaw stick each direction for a second or so,"
" returning to neutral for a second in-between direction reversals."
msgstr ""
"设置好陷波滤波器后，再进行一次悬停飞行，但短暂地在两个方向上做短促而快速的偏航摇杆动作。不要危及飞行器，但尽量获得几次向左向右的短暂全摇杆动作。您应该能够在每个方向保持全偏航摇杆约一秒，然后回到中立一秒再反向。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:12
#: b54d25cc24d14fa8815e039749bc2fb3
msgid ""
"Download the :ref:`dataflash log<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-"
"in-mission-planner>` for analysis. In order to determine the "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` term, use a log analyzer like "
"https://plot.ardupilot.org and setup the following plots on the same scale, "
"using the \"Add Expression\" button:"
msgstr ""
"下载 :ref:`数据闪存日志<common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-"
"planner>` 进行分析。为了确定 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` 项，使用日志分析工具如 "
"https://plot.ardupilot.org，并使用「添加表达式」按钮在同一比例下设置以下图表："

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:19
#: 96aaf03f2dc9474396107d15e3d4c6a6
msgid ""
"Next adjust the X value above until the magnitudes of both plots are about "
"equal. This will now be value for the :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` "
"term. Set the :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I<Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>` term to equal this."
msgstr ""
"接下来调整上述X值，直到两个图表的幅度大致相等。这将成为 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` 项的值。将 "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I<Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>` 项设置为与此相等。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:21
#: c781013e7a1748b69e6a26d6680b0485
msgid ""
"Below is an image of this where the X value is adjusted until the two curves"
" are the same amplitude, with a value of x = 0.1. This is then set as the "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` and "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I<Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>` values."
msgstr ""
"下图展示了调整 X 值直到两条曲线幅度相同的情况，值为 x = 0.1。然后将其设置为 "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF<Q_A_RAT_YAW_FF>` 和 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_I<Q_A_RAT_YAW_I>` "
"的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:26
#: 3fb6cbb431a544b586e33313e5ed2f5e
msgid ""
"Now you can hover again, and begin increasing the "
":ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_D<Q_A_RAT_YAW_D>` term, either iteratively, or using "
":ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`, until it oscillates and then reduce it to "
"1/2 to 1/3 that value."
msgstr ""
"现在可以再次悬停，开始逐步增加 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_D<Q_A_RAT_YAW_D>` 项，可以迭代增加，也可以使用 "
":ref:`common-transmitter-tuning`，直到出现振荡，然后将其降低到该值的1/2到1/3。"

#: ../../source/docs/tilt-vectored-yaw-tuning.rst:27
#: 0375ca24f82c429daae7636a3d13f960
msgid ""
"Then increase the :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P<Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` term, until it "
"oscillates and then reduce it  1/2 to 1/3 that value."
msgstr "然后增加 :ref:`Q_A_RAT_YAW_P<Q_A_RAT_YAW_P>` 项，直到出现振荡，然后将其降低到该值的1/2到1/3。"
